<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19040" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰθύ̆-κολπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with dress falling in deep
				folds</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαθύζωνος</span>),
			epith. of Trojan women, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.122
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				339
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				24.215
			</span></i>; of Nymphs, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ven.</u>
				257
			</span></i>; Muses, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρθένος</span> (of Aegina) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pae.</u>
				6.135
			</span></i>: hence, <i>with deep, full breasts,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ β. στηθέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					864
				</span></i>
			(lyr.): metaph. of the earth, <i>deep-bosomed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.101
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> simply,
				<i>very deep,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					12.327
				</span></i>
			; <i>with deep foundations,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				40.534
			</span></i>; <i>set deep,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχῆα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				21.94
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχαία, παλαιά, κοίλη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
